        }
      ],
      "createdAt": "2026-05-08T17:03:56.794Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-05-08T17:03:56.794Z",
      "userExplanation": {
        "summary": "Tests for the worktree-monitor feature are creating temporary branches in the real project repository instead of keeping them contained within isolated test environments. This pollutes the main codebase with leftover test data and causes errors when tests run multiple times (duplicate branches). The real fix is to give each test unique branch names so they don't interfere with each other or the actual development work.",
